# MCP server

- Endpoint: **`/mcp`** (Streamable HTTP via `mcp-handler` in `app/mcp/route.ts`).
- Tools live in `lib/mcp/tools.ts`; shared checklist state in `.data/active-checklist.json` through `lib/sessions/checklistStore.ts` (same store the UI polls via `/api/checklist`).
- ChatGPT flow: screenshots → extract ships + legs → `search_ships` / `search_locations` / `search_commodities` → `set_session_ships` + `replace_hauling_checklist`.
- Session ships (`shipSlugs`) come from UEX vehicle fixtures (`lib/fixtures/ships.json`); cargo SCU on those rows will drive bay capacity later.
- When adding tools: action-oriented names, “Use this when…” descriptions, zod `inputSchema`, keep instructions on the handler updated.
- Local ChatGPT testing needs a public HTTPS URL or Secure MCP Tunnel pointing at `/mcp`. Do not invent locations/commodities/ships outside fixtures.
